   "summary": "All freshmen start in MUP 171 unless piano is their concentration, in which case they enroll in MUP 111. If you already play well, ask the Music Office to schedule a hearing with the piano faculty and you may bypass some or all of class piano. Applied piano cannot be used as tutoring for the proficiency exam. All applied piano students take a jury at the end of the semester, and the piano faculty makes the final placement decision.",
