   "summary": "Talent Scholarships and, where applicable, Ensemble Awards require a cumulative 2.50 GPA, and no student may receive a Talent Scholarship for more than five years; exceptions are only granted by the Dean of the School of Music. Awards also depend on meeting your School of Music responsibilities and the terms in the university's Guide to Scholarships, Awards, and Grants. When you represent the university, the student handbook code of conduct applies, including not wearing other universities' clothing at those events.",
